        "original_id": "2a0f4d9b-e057-51e1-928f-81b34afe9166",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Shayang County, Mengzhou, Maliang Town, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, Henan Province, Kaifeng, Jiaozuo\n- People: Liu Xiwu, Wen Ding, Quan Wending\n- Organizations: People's Republic of China\n- Historical states: Quan, Chu\n\nFacts:\n- Quan Wending, a son of Wen Ding, founded the state of Quan in the area of modern Maliang Town in Shayang County, Jingmen City, Hubei Province, near the later state of Chu.\n- Shayang County is a county in west-central Hubei Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Mengzhou is a county-level city in Henan Province in the People's Republic of China.\n- Liu Xiwu was born in Meng County, Henan Province, which is modern Mengzhou in Jiaozuo, Henan Province.\n- Liu Xiwu was educated in Kaifeng.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
